  // Steepness falls off toward the short end (slope ∝ λ^1.5): the short ripples are feeble, so the light
  // patterns on the bed come from the 10–25 cm waves, as in a real pond — large, curving cells.
  // Many trains at random lengths and headings: a few regular ones cross into a visible lattice.
